        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDerelict stone ruin situated on a circa 1 acre site under folio CE46029F, fronting onto the L1098 Ballyharraghan Road. The elevated site rises gently from the roadway, is rectangular in shape, and enjoys a peaceful countryside setting just 7 km from Ennis.The site is being sold as is, there is an option for the site to be sold subject to planning if desired - for more information contact the agent. This convenient location offers excellent accessibility, ideal for those seeking a tranquil setting within easy reach of local amenities and excellent commuting links to Shannon, Limerick, and Galway.For further information, contact our office. PSL No. 002295"
